    {
      "text": "how often would I have gathered thy children together, Matt. 23:37 (Luke 13:34; D&C 10:65; 43:24). he should gather … the children of God, John 11:52. dispensation of the fulness of times he might gather, Eph. 1:10.",
      "references": [
